WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.570
Meet Sam. Seventeen...

2
00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:04.890
and about to buy a FIRST

3
00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:05.470
car.

4
00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:08.920
First — the deal is BORN.

5
00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.500
An advert. An offer.

6
00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.100
A counter-offer... and then?

7
00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:15.220
A deal!

8
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.910
Then... it gets TESTED.

9
00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.470
The dealer lied about a crash

10
00:00:20.354 --> 00:00:21.950
— so now,

11
00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:23.890
the deal can be UNDONE.

12
00:00:24.670 --> 00:00:26.840
And every deal ends.

13
00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.080
Paid, and done.

14
00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.380
Broken. Or lost in a flood...

15
00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:34.640
with no one to blame.

16
00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:36.190
That's a contract.

17
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:39.710
BORN. Tested. Ended.

18
00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:42.840
So ride every line — and

19
00:00:42.690 --> 00:00:43.880
take the quiz!

20
00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.360
This is... The Contract Line.
